WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:04.970
This is a work of fiction.
Underage drinking is strongly prohibited and illegal.
Scenes involving alcohol with forceful consumption and shameful acts are not encouraged. Please view this as a comedy. Furthermore, all characters appearing in this work are of legal age.

00:06.597 --> 00:08.265
The blazing sun!

00:09.642 --> 00:12.228
The blue sky! The blue sea!

00:13.520 --> 00:15.022
We're coming, resort lovers!

00:15.189 --> 00:16.690
Wait for us, mermaids!

00:17.149 --> 00:19.693
- We're going to Okinawa!
- We're going to Okinawa!

00:20.736 --> 00:22.696
Oh, there you are.

00:22.905 --> 00:23.906
Tokita?

00:24.073 --> 00:25.199
What happened?

00:25.407 --> 00:29.578
I found a good part-time job.
I thought you guys might want in.

00:30.371 --> 00:32.331
- A job?
- Why?

00:32.539 --> 00:34.875
To earn money for the trip, of course.

00:35.042 --> 00:37.294
I thought the tennis prize money...

00:37.461 --> 00:40.965
It'll only cover travel expenses.
The rest is out of pocket.

00:41.840 --> 00:43.092
Really?

00:43.259 --> 00:46.011
Well, are you going to take the job?

00:46.178 --> 00:48.180
Or not?

00:49.974 --> 00:53.811
Be passionate, my friends

00:54.019 --> 00:57.022
Shine bright with the sun

00:57.189 --> 01:00.609
Dive into the blue sky

01:00.818 --> 01:04.905
And let summer take it all

01:08.158 --> 01:11.495
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

01:18.752 --> 01:22.589
Be passionate, my friends

01:22.756 --> 01:25.843
Shine bright with the sun

01:26.010 --> 01:29.138
Dive into the blue sky

01:29.346 --> 01:33.392
And let summer take it all

01:33.559 --> 01:36.395
An expanding ocean of possibilities

01:36.562 --> 01:40.441
Summer is our amore

01:40.607 --> 01:44.111
We'll swear to the crystal clear sky

01:44.278 --> 01:47.239
Summer is in our hands

01:47.406 --> 01:51.327
Be passionate, my friends

01:51.493 --> 01:54.496
Shine bright with the sun

01:54.663 --> 01:57.958
Dive into the blue sky

01:58.167 --> 02:01.587
And let summer take it all

02:01.754 --> 02:05.758
With a cheerful heart

02:05.924 --> 02:08.761
Don't mess with me

02:08.927 --> 02:12.222
Keep going even if you fall

02:12.431 --> 02:16.060
And let summer take it all

