02:25.861 --> 02:28.447
What's wrong with you today?

02:30.115 --> 02:33.494
Hey. We need some money.

02:33.660 --> 02:36.830
Earning money is no easy feat.

02:36.997 --> 02:38.207
Money for the trip?

02:38.374 --> 02:43.045
What? Didn't Tokki get you guys a job?

02:43.212 --> 02:45.923
It's a job at a moving company.

02:46.090 --> 02:48.675
We worked yesterday.

02:51.887 --> 02:54.473
Okay, okay, okay.

02:54.640 --> 02:57.226
Okay, okay, okay.

02:57.393 --> 02:59.228
Here. Thanks for your hard work.

03:00.562 --> 03:02.606
So this is the reward for labor!

03:02.773 --> 03:05.234
See you next time.

03:09.780 --> 03:12.282
A drink tastes great after a hard day of labor!

03:12.449 --> 03:15.327
- Yeah.
- Another beer, please!

03:19.373 --> 03:22.126
That's what happens when you drink at a bar.

03:22.292 --> 03:24.211
Where's Tokki today?

03:24.378 --> 03:27.673
He said he's going to earn back
what he spent yesterday.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.133
You guys should too.

03:29.299 --> 03:31.969
I can't do such hard work two days in a row.

03:32.553 --> 03:35.389
Kotobuki isn't here today either.

03:35.556 --> 03:37.808
Bukki said he has work today too.

03:37.975 --> 03:39.768
- Work?
- That guy?

03:39.935 --> 03:41.728
I bet he's advertising for a brothel.

03:41.895 --> 03:44.273
Or he might be a show dancer.

03:44.440 --> 03:48.110
Is that what your impression of Kotobuki is?

03:48.569 --> 03:50.237
It's not like that.

03:50.821 --> 03:54.283
Do you want to go visit Bukki at work?

03:57.244 --> 03:58.370
Welcome!

03:59.705 --> 04:02.082
Hey! We've come to hang out.

04:04.835 --> 04:06.628
So you're a bartender.

04:06.920 --> 04:08.046
So cool!

04:08.213 --> 04:10.507
I just work here sometimes, part-time.

04:11.091 --> 04:12.759
What's wrong, you guys?

04:13.760 --> 04:17.306
That'll be 200,000 yen.

04:17.473 --> 04:21.810
Hi! Come on! Hi! Come on!

04:21.977 --> 04:24.062
I'm sorry!

04:25.481 --> 04:27.649
What kind of bar were they imagining?

04:27.816 --> 04:30.777
It's just a normal bar.

04:30.944 --> 04:33.864
They don't rip you off here. It's cheap.

04:34.031 --> 04:35.199
It's all under 500 yen.

04:35.365 --> 04:39.578
The owner wants this bar to be a place
where even students can have fun.

04:41.747 --> 04:42.748
Welcome!

04:42.915 --> 04:45.709
You're right. There are a lot of young customers.

04:45.876 --> 04:48.420
Welcome, Azusa-chan.

04:49.630 --> 04:52.007
Hi, master.

04:52.883 --> 04:54.968
Are you Ryu's friends?

04:55.135 --> 04:56.136
Yes.

04:56.303 --> 04:58.597
They wanted to see where Bukki works.

04:58.764 --> 05:00.891
So, what do you think?

05:01.058 --> 05:02.351
It just feels weird.

05:02.518 --> 05:04.353
When are you going to fire him?

05:04.520 --> 05:06.605
Don't be so direct.

05:06.772 --> 05:10.150
He's popular with the customers.

05:10.317 --> 05:12.945
There's this guy I like...

05:13.111 --> 05:14.947
But I don't think it'll work out.

05:16.323 --> 05:18.867
Don't worry so much. Just have courage.

05:19.034 --> 05:20.827
But...

05:22.329 --> 05:24.248
If it doesn't work out,

05:24.414 --> 05:27.209
I'll listen to you complain all night.

05:29.169 --> 05:33.382
I think I like you more than I like him.

05:34.132 --> 05:36.009
Hey, put a knife in his head.

05:36.176 --> 05:37.469
I'll use a fork.

05:37.636 --> 05:38.762
Knock it off.

05:38.929 --> 05:40.347
There's something wrong here.

05:40.514 --> 05:42.808
How can a girl like him just for that?

05:42.975 --> 05:45.936
Maybe bartenders are just popular with girls.

05:46.103 --> 05:48.897
Yeah. I think the job is just making him look good.

05:49.064 --> 05:50.315
You think so?

05:50.482 --> 05:54.152
I think it's because Bukki is pure and says nice things.

05:54.319 --> 05:56.071
Well, then...

05:56.822 --> 05:58.907
Why don't you guys try it out?

06:08.292 --> 06:10.002
It looks good on you two.

06:12.212 --> 06:13.213
What's wrong?

06:13.380 --> 06:14.381
Nothing. Well...

06:14.548 --> 06:16.258
It's sort of, you know...

06:18.510 --> 06:20.554
Keeping clothes on around alcohol...

06:20.721 --> 06:22.055
It feels very strange.

06:22.222 --> 06:24.641
Yeah, I know how you feel.

06:24.808 --> 06:26.810
I don't get it at all!

06:26.977 --> 06:31.189
Well, then... You guys take care of
Azusa and the ladies, okay?

06:32.941 --> 06:34.860
Well... Relax. Relax.

06:35.027 --> 06:37.821
It's just us. It's okay if you mess up.

06:39.239 --> 06:41.533
Are you guys going to try this?

06:42.451 --> 06:44.077
What do you want to order?

06:44.244 --> 06:47.789
Hold on a second.

06:47.956 --> 06:49.499
I'll have a gin lime.

06:49.666 --> 06:51.335
I'll have the same.

06:51.501 --> 06:52.544
Okay.

06:58.842 --> 07:00.093
Here's your gin lime.

07:00.260 --> 07:01.303
Thanks.

07:03.096 --> 07:05.265
I see. It's exactly the same as its name.

07:05.432 --> 07:07.601
Gin and lime. Gin lime.

07:07.768 --> 07:10.729
All right, I'll have a screwdriver!

07:10.896 --> 07:12.648
A screwdriver...

07:12.814 --> 07:13.815
I got it.

07:18.528 --> 07:20.030
Here's your screwdriver.

07:20.197 --> 07:21.365
Hold on.

07:21.531 --> 07:24.534
- What?
- What do you mean, "What"?

07:24.701 --> 07:26.745
There's obviously something wrong here!

07:26.912 --> 07:28.288
We got it wrong after all?

07:28.455 --> 07:29.164
VODKA AND ORANGE JUICE

07:29.331 --> 07:30.999
But this has to be the screwdriver.

07:31.166 --> 07:33.877
Are you guys making fun of me?

07:34.044 --> 07:35.087
No.

07:35.253 --> 07:36.713
That's not the case...

07:37.214 --> 07:40.467
Excuse me. That was a little joke just now.

07:41.343 --> 07:43.512
Here's your screwdriver.

07:43.679 --> 07:45.222
Thanks.

07:48.642 --> 07:49.559
FLAT-BLADE SCREWDRIVER

07:50.811 --> 07:52.437
Hey, it was wrong!

07:52.604 --> 07:55.482
That's why I kept telling you
to use a precision screwdriver!

07:56.233 --> 07:58.026
I'm going to order something else!

07:58.193 --> 08:00.487
I'll have a Moscow mule!

08:02.280 --> 08:05.617
- Moss...?
- Community...?

08:07.786 --> 08:09.037
- Marimo!
- That's it!

08:09.204 --> 08:10.747
What are you talking about?

08:10.914 --> 08:12.541
VODKA, LIME JUICE, GINGER ALE

08:13.166 --> 08:14.918
Do it right!

08:15.085 --> 08:16.211
Calm down.

08:16.378 --> 08:18.046
Practice makes perfect.

08:18.213 --> 08:19.840
Those guys are funny.

08:20.006 --> 08:22.384
Right?

08:22.968 --> 08:26.096
If there's a drink you don't know,
look it up in here.

08:27.514 --> 08:29.641
With this, we need not fear anymore!

08:29.808 --> 08:32.644
I wish you had given them that earlier.

08:33.562 --> 08:37.232
A lot of cocktails have confusing names.

08:37.399 --> 08:40.193
It's because you don't have a good imagination.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.361
Really?

08:41.528 --> 08:45.157
For me, it's easy to imagine
what it looks like just from the name.

08:45.323 --> 08:47.075
Then what about this?

08:47.784 --> 08:49.411
Sex on the beach.

08:49.578 --> 08:51.288
VODKA, MELON LIQUOR, LEMON JUICE,
CREME DE FRAMBOISE, PINEAPPLE JUICE

08:54.332 --> 08:55.917
Cherry blossom.

08:56.084 --> 08:57.794
CHERRY BRANDY, BRANDY, LEMON JUICE,
GRENADINE, ORANGE CURACAO

09:00.046 --> 09:01.840
I'm going to lose my virginity!

09:02.007 --> 09:04.468
What are you trying to make me imagine?

09:04.634 --> 09:07.095
You imagined it all by yourself!

09:07.262 --> 09:08.805
Stop! You should be ashamed!

09:10.223 --> 09:14.478
Let's talk about something
more suited to a stylish place like this.

09:15.687 --> 09:16.730
Like what?

09:16.897 --> 09:20.817
Like something they always show in movies and dramas.

09:21.985 --> 09:23.779
It's my treat.

09:26.656 --> 09:29.868
Let's toast to your beautiful eyes.

09:31.203 --> 09:32.287
I see.

09:32.454 --> 09:34.748
I'm sure it's too hard for you guys.

09:34.915 --> 09:36.333
What's that? How rude.

09:36.500 --> 09:38.710
We'll show you.

09:39.503 --> 09:40.962
- Here we go.
- Yeah.

09:47.677 --> 09:50.055
It's my treat.

09:57.479 --> 10:01.024
- My eyes! My eyes!
- Let's make a toast with your eyes.

10:01.191 --> 10:03.527
You ruined the beautiful scene in my head!

10:03.693 --> 10:05.904
Who pours alcohol in other people's eyes?

10:06.071 --> 10:10.158
Shut up! You threw alcohol on me first!

10:10.325 --> 10:13.120
Those two are really close.

10:13.662 --> 10:15.956
They're always together.

10:16.122 --> 10:18.667
What's their relationship like?

10:18.834 --> 10:20.794
Their relationship?

10:20.961 --> 10:22.921
Well...

10:23.088 --> 10:24.756
- A naked one.
- A naked one.

10:27.467 --> 10:29.886
There you go again. You're joking, right?

10:30.053 --> 10:31.555
No. It's for real.

10:31.721 --> 10:33.807
Why don't you ask them?

10:33.974 --> 10:36.893
Iori, can I ask you something?

10:37.060 --> 10:38.770
Yes?

10:41.064 --> 10:43.149
Are you dating someone?

10:43.859 --> 10:47.654
Well, now that you mention it, I am.

10:48.154 --> 10:49.155
I guess.

10:50.323 --> 10:51.658
"I guess"?

10:52.826 --> 10:56.162
Is that person's hair about this long?

10:56.913 --> 10:58.456
That's about right.

10:58.623 --> 11:02.335
Does that person look cold, but is actually an airhead?

11:02.502 --> 11:04.045
That's right.

11:05.547 --> 11:08.300
Are there a lot of barriers between you two?

11:10.468 --> 11:12.804
Yeah. That's exactly right.

11:15.015 --> 11:16.725
Why do you ask?

11:16.892 --> 11:19.311
It's nothing. I don't mind!

11:19.477 --> 11:22.772
Everyone's love is unique. Yeah!

11:22.939 --> 11:26.443
You surprised me. I'm thirsty now.

11:26.610 --> 11:28.153
How about some oolong tea?

11:28.320 --> 11:29.905
Specially made, PAB-style.

11:30.071 --> 11:31.740
I don't need your oolong tea.

11:31.907 --> 11:33.992
Then I'll have some.

11:41.833 --> 11:43.126
Oh, dear.

11:43.293 --> 11:44.920
He can't drink much.

11:45.086 --> 11:45.545
VODKA AND WHISKEY

11:45.712 --> 11:48.131
With a drink like that,
of course this would happen.

11:48.298 --> 11:51.927
I give up. Once he's out like this,
he won't wake up.

11:52.093 --> 11:53.428
If something happens--

11:53.595 --> 11:56.389
I'm not drunk!

11:56.556 --> 12:00.101
Let's try talking to him.

12:01.144 --> 12:04.356
Master? Master!

12:06.524 --> 12:09.277
I'm warning you...

12:09.444 --> 12:11.363
If you fall asleep now,

12:11.947 --> 12:15.617
I don't know what's going to happen to you.

12:21.289 --> 12:23.875
Let's have one more drink!

12:24.042 --> 12:26.795
I never imagined he'd recover so fast.

12:26.962 --> 12:29.422
Did you say something to him?

12:29.589 --> 12:33.385
No, I just gave him the usual warning.

12:33.551 --> 12:34.928
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

12:43.103 --> 12:44.270
Hey!

12:44.437 --> 12:45.939
We bought some beer.

12:46.106 --> 12:47.774
You're late.

12:47.941 --> 12:49.943
The yakitori is going to get cold.

12:50.110 --> 12:51.444
Sorry. Sorry.

12:51.611 --> 12:54.322
We were at work.

12:56.366 --> 12:58.326
Well, then... Cheers!

12:58.493 --> 12:59.786
Cheers!

13:03.581 --> 13:05.834
Sometimes I think to myself...

13:06.751 --> 13:07.836
What happened?

13:08.003 --> 13:10.213
Why can't I find a girlfriend?

13:10.380 --> 13:12.132
- Bad face.
- Bad personality.

13:12.298 --> 13:13.299
Poor life choices.

13:13.466 --> 13:14.467
Just give up.

13:14.634 --> 13:16.845
You guys are so harsh, it's shocking!

13:17.012 --> 13:19.097
What? Don't worry about it, Yamamoto.

13:19.264 --> 13:24.019
Most of the guys in our grade
don't have girlfriends.

13:24.185 --> 13:25.186
Well, yeah.

13:26.187 --> 13:29.190
Right, Kitahara?

13:30.108 --> 13:32.777
I've never touched her!

13:32.944 --> 13:34.946
You have nothing to be jealous of!

13:35.113 --> 13:36.114
Good.

13:36.281 --> 13:37.490
Then we forgive you.

13:38.116 --> 13:41.995
You guys were so hard on me the other day.

13:43.329 --> 13:45.373
Oh, that felt good!

13:45.540 --> 13:47.584
Mitarai was terrible.

13:47.751 --> 13:48.835
Here you go, Ikebana!

13:49.002 --> 13:53.798
He put weeds in your mouth when you passed out
and called it "ikebana."

13:53.965 --> 13:55.759
You guys aren't human.

13:55.925 --> 13:57.969
Now that you mention Mitarai...

13:58.136 --> 13:59.137
What?

13:59.304 --> 14:01.097
He doesn't hang out with us anymore.

14:01.264 --> 14:02.265
You're right.

14:02.432 --> 14:04.267
Maybe he got a girlfriend.

14:04.434 --> 14:06.019
No way.

14:06.186 --> 14:10.023
His looks alone,
it wouldn't be weird if he did have a girlfriend.

14:10.190 --> 14:11.399
Maybe you're right.

14:11.566 --> 14:14.360
What would you do if he did have a girlfriend?

14:15.862 --> 14:19.449
That's impossible. I believe in him.

14:19.616 --> 14:22.827
Mitarai is the one who talked to me first...

14:22.994 --> 14:26.289
when I didn't fit in during class.

14:26.456 --> 14:29.918
Were you taking notes just now? Can I copy them?

14:30.085 --> 14:32.545
That's how I met you, Nojima,

14:32.712 --> 14:35.381
and that's why I'm here drinking with all of you today.

14:35.882 --> 14:36.883
Yamamoto...

14:37.467 --> 14:38.676
That's right.

14:38.843 --> 14:39.844
Yeah.

14:40.011 --> 14:42.305
Let's invite Mitarai.

14:42.472 --> 14:44.432
Hold on. Let's call him.

14:44.599 --> 14:46.392
YUU MITARAI

14:50.438 --> 14:51.439
Hello?

14:51.606 --> 14:52.982
Hey, Mitarai.

14:53.149 --> 14:55.568
We're drinking at Yamamoto's. If you're free--

14:55.735 --> 14:59.697
Sorry! I'll call back in 15-- No, 30 minutes!

15:02.242 --> 15:04.994
- What happened?
- It's nothing.

15:07.205 --> 15:08.832
I see.

15:08.998 --> 15:10.542
In 30 minutes.

15:11.584 --> 15:14.087
That bastard. He's having sex with a girl.

15:14.254 --> 15:15.922
Yeah!

15:16.422 --> 15:17.715
That's what he said.

15:17.882 --> 15:19.175
I see.

15:19.342 --> 15:21.594
No wonder he doesn't hang out with us.

15:21.761 --> 15:24.013
He should have just told us.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.598
Yeah.

15:25.765 --> 15:27.934
Well, then...

15:28.518 --> 15:30.019
Let's go set him on fire.

15:30.186 --> 15:32.105
Does anyone know where he lives?

15:32.272 --> 15:34.149
- Leave it to me.
- Good job!

15:34.315 --> 15:36.860
I'll give you a reward later.

15:37.026 --> 15:40.697
Listen, we're not going to let him get his wish!

15:45.535 --> 15:46.619
What's wrong?

15:46.786 --> 15:49.956
It's nothing. Anyway...

15:53.459 --> 15:54.878
Let's continue...

15:55.044 --> 15:56.462
You're so horny.

15:59.841 --> 16:02.635
Is it them?

16:02.802 --> 16:05.263
No... It's too early...

16:05.430 --> 16:07.932
You've got a package!

16:09.684 --> 16:11.269
Mr. Mitarai...

16:11.436 --> 16:13.688
are you home?

16:13.855 --> 16:15.273
Shouldn't you answer it?

16:15.440 --> 16:19.527
No. There's something more important right now.

16:19.694 --> 16:23.364
Mr. Mitarai, you've got a package!

16:23.531 --> 16:24.949
He's still calling you.

16:25.116 --> 16:26.826
Mr. Mitarai!

16:26.993 --> 16:28.786
He'll go away soon.

16:28.953 --> 16:34.417
I've brought the assorted collection
of 200 porn videos you ordered.

16:34.584 --> 16:36.211
200 porn videos?

16:36.377 --> 16:40.381
They're animal videos. I'm into animals recently.

16:40.548 --> 16:42.133
Oh, really?

16:48.598 --> 16:51.184
Excuse me! They won't all fit.

16:51.351 --> 16:54.604
Open the door please!

16:54.771 --> 16:56.689
Animal videos, huh?

16:58.066 --> 16:59.943
That's weird...

17:00.109 --> 17:01.402
This trick...

17:01.903 --> 17:04.739
It must be them!

17:04.906 --> 17:06.658
Are you sure about this, Yamamoto?

17:06.824 --> 17:08.743
Your prized DVD collection...

17:08.910 --> 17:10.495
I don't care.

17:10.662 --> 17:14.082
If my unhappiness can destroy his happiness...

17:14.249 --> 17:16.251
It must feel refreshing!

17:16.417 --> 17:19.087
What a feel-good loser!

17:21.172 --> 17:22.382
The lights went off!

17:22.548 --> 17:25.093
He's planning to plow through!

17:25.260 --> 17:26.636
What do we do, Kitahara?

17:26.803 --> 17:28.388
Leave it to me.

17:28.554 --> 17:31.933
Now we won't be bothered anymore.

17:32.100 --> 17:34.769
You must be feeling good today...

17:34.936 --> 17:37.230
Silhouette quiz!

17:38.273 --> 17:40.525
What is this?

17:40.692 --> 17:42.318
What are they up to now?

17:42.485 --> 17:45.780
Though, that's the famous Birth of Venus!

17:45.947 --> 17:48.658
The answer is, The Thinker.

17:48.825 --> 17:50.785
You're wrong!

17:50.952 --> 17:53.371
Hey, what's going on?

17:53.538 --> 17:55.456
Nothing.

17:55.623 --> 17:58.167
Just keep looking at me.

17:58.334 --> 17:59.335
How was it?

17:59.502 --> 18:00.920
I think it's working.

18:01.087 --> 18:02.672
We need something more.

18:02.839 --> 18:05.508
Then let's try this.

18:05.675 --> 18:06.718
What are you doing?

18:06.884 --> 18:10.888
I'm changing my LINE display name to "Ami."

18:15.101 --> 18:17.437
HEY YUU, I MISS YOU.

18:17.603 --> 18:20.064
- It was just spam.
- Let me see!

18:20.273 --> 18:21.107
THE HOTEL WE WENT TO WAS FUN.

18:21.274 --> 18:22.108
LET'S HAVE SEX SOMEWHERE ELSE NEXT TIME.

18:22.275 --> 18:23.109
DON'T CHEAT ON ME!

18:25.236 --> 18:26.237
What's this?

18:26.404 --> 18:27.780
This is...

18:27.947 --> 18:32.452
My guy friend changed his name
and is playing a prank on me!

18:32.618 --> 18:33.619
Are you sure?

18:33.786 --> 18:34.912
I'm sure! I'm sure!

18:35.079 --> 18:38.708
I told you I don't know any girls!

18:38.875 --> 18:41.127
If you don't believe me,

18:41.294 --> 18:44.839
I'll show you our entire chat history!

18:45.006 --> 18:48.176
Damn. He's taking advantage
of the lack of girls in our group!

18:48.926 --> 18:49.927
Can't we do anything?

18:50.094 --> 18:52.388
How about playing audio of a porn actress?

18:52.555 --> 18:55.224
We don't have time for that!

18:55.391 --> 18:57.018
They're so foolish.

18:57.185 --> 19:01.689
I've been playing along until now,
but she's just a 3D girl.

19:02.190 --> 19:05.985
I'm going back to my holy land.

19:06.152 --> 19:09.405
If that's what you say, I'll believe you.

19:09.572 --> 19:11.866
So just turn off your phone,

19:12.033 --> 19:14.494
brother Yuu!

19:14.661 --> 19:17.789
Hey, stop calling me that.

19:17.955 --> 19:19.457
What?

19:19.624 --> 19:22.752
She called him "brother"?

19:22.919 --> 19:24.170
Well...

19:24.337 --> 19:27.548
It's a habit from when we were kids.

19:27.715 --> 19:30.510
I never imagined we'd be dating like this.

19:30.676 --> 19:34.514
When I saw you after all this time
I thought you were really cute.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.224
Stop it!

19:38.476 --> 19:43.898
They're childhood friends?

19:44.065 --> 19:45.191
Damn!

19:45.358 --> 19:47.819
Isn't there anything else we can do?

19:47.985 --> 19:49.654
You...

19:49.821 --> 19:51.114
Leave it to me.

19:51.823 --> 19:53.491
Imamura?

19:53.658 --> 19:58.913
I'm going to show you
the mixed voice technique!

19:59.080 --> 20:01.874
Why are you crying?

20:02.709 --> 20:04.961
You're the only one for me.

20:05.128 --> 20:06.129
Really?

20:06.879 --> 20:09.048
Of course.

20:09.841 --> 20:12.427
Yuu, I'm here!

20:12.593 --> 20:15.346
How come he sounds so natural as a girl?

20:15.513 --> 20:17.265
What's a mixed voice?

20:17.432 --> 20:20.351
It's a technique to make your voice high-pitched.

20:20.518 --> 20:24.939
You have weird hidden talents.

20:25.106 --> 20:26.566
You flatter me.

20:26.732 --> 20:28.401
Anyway, good job, Imamura!

20:28.568 --> 20:31.946
Let's say our last prayers for that bastard!

20:32.113 --> 20:35.324
Hey, Yuu! Who are these girls?

20:35.491 --> 20:39.078
I know you're home!
Why aren't you answering the door?

20:39.245 --> 20:43.249
Were you lying to me when you told me
you loved me that night?

20:45.918 --> 20:48.838
Goodbye. Don't ever contact me again!

20:49.005 --> 20:50.548
Wait!

20:51.382 --> 20:52.675
That worked, right?

20:53.968 --> 20:55.094
Wonderful.

20:55.261 --> 20:57.722
My guy friends are playing a trick on me.

20:57.889 --> 20:59.974
I'm going to cut those guys out of my life.

21:00.141 --> 21:02.101
I don't believe you!

21:02.268 --> 21:05.021
That was an unpleasant situation.

21:06.314 --> 21:09.650
Let's treat him like a traitor from now on.

21:09.817 --> 21:12.069
Yeah. I thought he was better than that!

21:12.236 --> 21:14.238
What's wrong, Kitahara?

21:14.405 --> 21:17.492
Are you still trying to check up on that traitor?

21:17.658 --> 21:20.620
He already broke things off with us.

21:20.786 --> 21:24.707
Yeah. He did say he's going to cut us out of his life.

21:25.458 --> 21:26.792
But...

21:26.959 --> 21:29.128
I still want to believe in him.

21:29.295 --> 21:31.839
- What are you saying?
- You guys...

21:33.174 --> 21:35.009
Look at him closely.

21:35.176 --> 21:38.763
His eyes are still wet.

21:38.930 --> 21:40.348
Okay...

21:40.515 --> 21:42.975
I'll give up on you.

21:43.142 --> 21:44.143
Yeah. Do that.

21:44.310 --> 21:47.355
But what else can he do now?

21:47.522 --> 21:50.525
All he can do now is say goodbye.

21:50.691 --> 21:51.859
I don't know.

21:52.026 --> 21:54.862
- I don' t know. But I can sense it.
- Sense what?

21:55.530 --> 21:57.657
I sense a loser.

21:57.823 --> 22:00.368
What happened to your senses?

22:01.160 --> 22:04.205
There's just one thing I want to say.

22:04.372 --> 22:05.373
What?

22:06.332 --> 22:09.377
If we're not a couple anymore...

22:11.629 --> 22:14.382
can you introduce me to your friends?

22:24.684 --> 22:29.564
We really are best friends!

22:32.191 --> 22:33.442
DEEP BLUE AL FINE
KAYA MIZUKI

22:33.609 --> 22:35.695
Here's your mic, Kitahara.

22:35.903 --> 22:39.949
Me, too...? All right, let's do this!

22:40.116 --> 22:43.452
- Yeah, sing your heart out.
- You guys seem to be having fun.

22:45.121 --> 22:51.127
A fairytale whispers
In a fake world

22:51.294 --> 22:57.049
Hiding in the complete darkness

22:57.216 --> 23:03.014
I reach for the forbidden fruit
In my last days

23:03.180 --> 23:09.312
Now I know the meaning of the song about hope

23:09.478 --> 23:14.567
A broken gear will never stop again

23:14.734 --> 23:22.158
Even if I were to lose everything
I'd still want you to know

23:22.325 --> 23:28.247
Trapped in the sky so far away
I'm praying with ripped off wings

23:28.456 --> 23:34.211
Because we span together
The vows of areppegio

23:34.378 --> 23:40.134
If life sparkles only to the beat
of the resonating stars

23:40.301 --> 23:43.137
I'll sacrifice everything

23:43.304 --> 23:47.683
Till death do us apart

23:47.892 --> 23:49.769
Cheers!

23:54.523 --> 23:57.193
Have a good night!

24:03.324 --> 24:05.951
Truth or dare!

24:07.870 --> 24:09.080
It's me.

24:09.246 --> 24:10.331
Give me your orders.

24:10.498 --> 24:13.876
Numbers one through seven have to strip.

24:14.043 --> 24:15.628
In that case...

24:15.795 --> 24:16.921
NEXT EPISODE
"TRUTH OR DARE"
